flowchart TD
    A[CSV or in-memory Dataset] --> B[Validate dimensions and finite values]
    B --> C[Split into training and test rows]
    C --> D[Cross-validate lambda on training rows]
    D --> E[Fit scaler on training rows]
    E --> F[Transform training and test rows with same scaler]
    F --> G[Fit coordinate-descent LASSO]
    G --> H[Predict held-out test rows]
    H --> I[Calculate MAE, MSE, RMSE and R-squared]
    G --> J[Report selected feature indexes]
